1
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:25,780
Once I was dead, I lived for self

2
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:29,060
Offending God, ignoring Him

3
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:32,580
I walked the world’s dark crooked ways

4
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,900
Deceived by lies and empty praise

5
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:39,340
I bowed my heart to selfish pride

6
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,740
My cravings ruled, they were my guide

7
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:46,140
But Christ so rich in mercy’s grace

8
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:49,700
He paid my sin and took my place

9
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,080
His love so great, so deep, so high

10
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:56,480
He raised me up, I'll never die

11
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:59,900
He took my soul from death’s dark helm

12
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:03,800
Now seated with Christ in heaven’s realm

13
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:09,980
Oh-oh, immeasurable grace

14
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:17,500
Oh-oh, how glorious Your ways

15
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:22,520
Oh-oh, forever I'll praise

16
00:01:22,690 --> 00:01:25,820
Your goodness in Christ

17
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:29,640
Your mercy that saves

18
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:37,670
Your immeasurable grace

19
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:47,980
I followed darkness, so blind and proud

20
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:51,280
A voice within the rebel crowd

21
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:54,840
I lived to feed my flesh and mind

22
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:58,300
No thought of God, no truth to find

23
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:01,660
By nature I deserved His wrath

24
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:04,980
Stumbling down a fatal path

25
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:08,460
But God displayed His richest grace

26
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:11,820
A love that time will not erase

27
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:15,460
By grace through faith, not by my doing

28
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:18,800
The gift of God, my boast removing

29
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,200
In Jesus Christ I’ve been remade

30
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:26,320
For the good works which God ordained

31
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:32,530
Oh-oh, immeasurable grace

32
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:39,820
Oh-oh, how glorious Your ways

33
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:45,030
Oh-oh, forever I'll praise

34
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:48,340
Your goodness in Christ

35
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:51,840
Your mercy that saves

36
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:59,270
Your immeasurable grace

37
00:02:59,390 --> 00:03:03,240
From death to life, You called my name

38
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:06,620
Now I’m alive to praise Your name

39
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:10,160
No longer lost, no longer bound

40
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:14,220
In Christ alone, I’ve been made found

41
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:20,370
Oh-oh, immeasurable grace

42
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:27,910
Oh-oh, how glorious Your ways

43
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:32,700
Oh-oh, forever I'll praise

44
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:36,260
Your goodness in Christ

45
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:39,600
Your mercy that saves

46
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:46,930
Your immeasurable grace

47
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:54,360
Immeasurable grace, unfailing and true

48
00:03:54,360 --> 00:04:01,380
Forever I’ll live to worship You

49
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:14,160
To sing of your immeasurable grace

50
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:24,870
Immeasurable grace

51
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:34,110
Immeasurable grace
